Z||000000||87ECO5||02-24-2000||12:44 PM||||Regarding the faux brushed aluminum ('84-'87) and graphite ('88) panels that cover our gauges, HVAC controls, stereo and shifter ...<P>What do you all think about a black finish with chrome bezels?  It looks awful good in the Mazda Miata and BMW Z3.  Do you think it'd look good in the Fiero?  I was thinking a chrome bezel around every cutout except the small warning lights and odometer.<P>Now, who could make these and how much?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||5
Z||000001||william_thorniii||02-24-2000||01:07 PM||||87EC,<P>I think that there are several people working on a type of solution to this.  This is an interesting twist though.  Only time will tell.<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
